 single player

Owner ruling 2026-09-26: co-op matches single player. A live (sliced)
crossing and host shells skipped the geological shoulders because their
per-section RefCounted breathe could lose a nested continuation; the sections
now yield through the world's own _build_breathe(), and shoulders always
build. Solo unchanged.

Proof: tests/smoke_cloudreach_coop_shoulders.gd -- live build 0 -> 720
ridges / 218 walkable collisions, identical to solo; FAIL on main, PASS here.
